SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

The MIT licence above covers this project's own source code only — everything
under app/, components/, lib/, and scripts/.

It does NOT cover:

  * The Faerûn map artwork, which is copyright Wizards of the Coast and used
    under their Fan Content Policy. That is revocable permission, not a licence.
    This covers the tile pyramid in public/tiles/ too: the tiles are this
    project's own cut, but the artwork in them is Wizards of the Coast's.
  * The article text in public/data/Faerun/wiki/, mirrored from the Forgotten
    Realms Wiki and licensed CC BY-SA 3.0 — which continues to apply, including
    its share-alike requirement.

Nothing here asserts any claim over those materials. See NOTICE for the
attributions.
